ilization will increase month after month","page":4,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e54d4d8-32a5-4d3c-aca0-c9459e230fa8.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Oct 2026"},{"point":"EPC segment continues to post small losses while winding down","quote":"in next 1 or 2 quarters, the INR 5 crores to INR 7 crores loss will be there because we are almost closing down the EPC","page":13,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e54d4d8-32a5-4d3c-aca0-c9459e230fa8.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Oct 2026"}],"watch":[{"point":"Whether Sanand Phase 2 commercial production starts on time and ramps up","quote":"The planned commercial production of Phase 2 of extra high-voltage cable and HT cable in Sanand will commence by end of March '27","page":4,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e54d4d8-32a5-4d3c-aca0-c9459e230fa8.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Oct 2026"},{"point":"Whether inventory normalizes and working capital days fall as promised","quote":"it is by the end of the year, it will get normalized to the earlier level. The holding level will remain same by the March '27","page":12,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e54d4d8-32a5-4d3c-aca0-c9459e230fa8.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Oct 2026"}],"sources":["Earnings call, Oct 2026"],"as_of":"2026-11-15T18:54:10+05:30"}}